        "image": "shopify://shop_images/8.png",
        "title": "Milano Jewelry Aruba",
        "text": "<p>Visit Milano at <strong>Aruba</strong> and explore a refined collection of fine jewelry inspired by the ease and elegance of island life. From luminous diamonds to sun-warmed gold, each piece is designed to feel timeless. Enjoy a moment of calm, personal service, and beautifully wrapped pieces to take home - or wear out tonight.</p>",
